WEBVTT

00:01:30.010 --> 00:01:33.310
Touda means fighting serpents.

00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:41.800
In ancient times, when the ancestor of the Queen descended from Ephon Noha to Tahai Aze,

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:47.690
the people met the Founding King, Je, who was tall and had golden eyes.

00:01:47.690 --> 00:01:51.850
He was the holy God Himself.

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:18.420
The war against Larza has begun.

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:23.450
There will be more bloodshed, won't there?

00:02:23.690 --> 00:02:29.520
As long as we have the Grand Duke's lionhearted warriors and Touda on the field, our victory will be absolute.

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:31.420
Please rest assured.

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:36.910
Queen

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:47.400
Ani-ue!

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:48.900
Calm down, Ngan!

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:11.790
There are Touda!
Note: <i>Touda</i>, meaning "fighting serpent."

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:13.000
Fire!  Fire!
Note: <i>Touda</i>, meaning "fighting serpent."

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:13.040
Note: <i>Touda</i>, meaning "fighting serpent."

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:34.770
Grand Duke

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:40.360
The Touda is a symbol of our Highness' authority.
Grand Duke

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:49.260
The capital, which is governed by the Queen whom everyone honors, is protected by the Grand Duke's lionhearted army,

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:52.870
and has always maintained a zenith of prosperity.

00:03:56.070 --> 00:04:01.870
Erin of the Green Eyes

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:08.260
Far from the battlefield is a small village.

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:09.500
The village's name is Ake.

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:10.490
Ake Village
The village's name is Ake.

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:10.890
Ake Village

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:15.930
It's a special village within the Grand Duke's quarter which raises Touda.
Ake Village

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:16.590
Ake Village

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:49.320
Have you seen Erin?

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:51.740
No.

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:53.000
I see.

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:00.190
She thinks she's a Touda beastinarian, even though she's a woman.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:01.530
Stop that.

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:09.260
Erin-chan?  Isn't she working?

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:13.250
She should be out of work by now...

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:15.300
Oba-san!

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:17.940
I saw Erin behind the medicine shack.

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:19.750
Yeah, she was there.

00:05:20.270 --> 00:05:22.050
She's still at the medicine shack?

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:24.050
Thank you.

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:30.290
Was she sucked in by something strange again?

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:31.850
Probably.

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:43.760
She left them unfinished again.

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:47.740
Erin!

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:51.260
Where could she have gone to?

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:04.970
Oh, Erin...

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:06.590
Erin!

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:09.970
Hey, Mom!

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:12.780
Look, a togera hopper.

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:15.240
Forget that!

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:16.700
It's already noon.

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:21.590
Where did it go?

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:26.510
Weren't you supposed to make polish balls using capracide by noon?

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:31.880
I'm sorry.

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:37.510
I wanted to make some benetrophic water for the baby Touda, so I was looking for the ingredients.

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:44.920
When benetrophic water mixes with the mucus on a Touda's skin and enters its body,

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:49.090
it strengthens them and also gets rid of parasites.

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:49.110
But benetrophic water is made for adult Touda, so it's too strong for an infant.
it strengthens them and also gets rid of parasites.

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:55.970
But benetrophic water is made for adult Touda, so it's too strong for an infant.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:03.600
So that's why!

00:07:04.260 --> 00:07:10.910
So that's why you use a polish ball as bug repellent when they still aren't strong enough.

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:16.810
I'll help you too, so let's finish them up, shall we?

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:17.580
Yup.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:25.830
Erin was happy to be with her mother.

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:34.670
It is the same for Soyon. Since they were the only ones in their family, she cherished their time together.

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:37.450
Mom, has the baby grown?

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:44.980
Let's see.  I think it can eat solid food soon, but it may be too early to put it in the pond.

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:48.450
Once it's in the pond, can I look after it?

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:52.790
I want to become a Touda doctor just like you.

00:07:55.540 --> 00:08:00.710
I'll think about it if you still feel the same way after you've grown a little bigger.

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:02.610
But not now.

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:03.790
Why not?

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:08.830
In the pond, it's not just baby Touda.  There are scary adult Touda, too.

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:12.500
They're not scary.  Touda are very tame.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:16.300
They're like logs.  They don't move much.

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:18.550
It's because I'm keeping them tame.

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:22.720
I'm suppressing them with something invisible.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:30.400
Soyon!  A Touda's been brought in from the war.

00:08:30.590 --> 00:08:32.090
It's severely wounded.

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:33.350
I'll be right there.

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:35.060
I need to head out.

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:35.970
Okay.

00:08:40.340 --> 00:08:42.970
Get the tail!  Tie down the tail!

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:48.510
What are you doing?!  Hold it down!

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:52.970
Soyon!

00:08:58.810 --> 00:09:00.010
Soyon.

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:07.290
What are you looking at?

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:08.950
There's a Touda.

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:11.540
Your mom was so cool.

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:14.370
She made the wild Touda tame.

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:17.440
Douse it with water and cool it down.

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:18.640
All right.

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:22.930
Then cover it with wet straw so that its body won't dry out.

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:24.260
All right.

00:09:27.070 --> 00:09:28.860
Make way!  Make way!

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:31.510
Oh, it's Wadan-san.

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:35.750
What are you all doing?  Didn't you hear me?

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:40.310
It's the baby Touda!

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:47.010
Get out of the way now.  I need to put it in the pond.

00:09:49.010 --> 00:09:51.730
Mom said that it's still too early.

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:53.450
Erin-chan?

00:09:54.930 --> 00:09:57.170
Mom said that it's still too early.

00:09:57.170 --> 00:09:57.910
What?

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:02.410
Green eyes...

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:04.660
You must be a daughter of the Mist People.

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:09.750
I've been working with Touda longer than that woman of the Mist People.

00:10:10.070 --> 00:10:12.210
And <i>I </i>say it's time.

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:13.780
But...

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:16.840
What's the matter here?

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:20.040
Mom.

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:22.310
Look.  It's about time we put it in the pond, no?

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:29.410
Please let me look at it.

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:41.950
Looks like it'll be able to eat food.

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:48.340
Okay.  But before you put it in the pond, please coat it with mucus from the Touda over there.

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:52.010
Also, make sure to replace the straw mat with a new one.

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:53.210
All right.

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:54.860
Hey, let's go.

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:03.380
I'll be coming home late today, all right?

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:07.540
Okay.

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:54.770
Did I wake you up?

00:11:55.210 --> 00:12:00.880
No.  I smelled the scent of a Touda, so I knew it was you.

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:01.760
Did you?

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:04.100
Is the baby doing fine?

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:05.850
Yes, it's doing well.

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:07.590
That's great.

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:12.760
Can I sleep with you?

00:12:15.020 --> 00:12:19.060
Sure.  It'll be warmer if we sleep together.

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:19.970
Yup.

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:51.770
When the morning comes, men head to the pond in the mountain,

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:57.770
and the women and children are left at home to work on household chores and farms.

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:03.000
But this morning was a little different from the others.

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:04.620
Is it good?

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:05.600
Yup!

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:08.070
Soyon!

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:13.060
We have a problem.  The baby Touda's gone!

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:18.500
If we can't find the baby, we'll have you abide by the village's code, do you hear?

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:21.630
I know.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:24.210
Mom...

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:28.420
Wadan-san!  You're the one who brought the baby out.

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:32.970
But it's this woman who permitted the baby to be put in the pond!

00:13:33.930 --> 00:13:35.540
I admit that.

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:38.770
But what we must do now is search for it.

00:13:39.770 --> 00:13:41.650
I don't see any sign of reflection.

00:13:42.140 --> 00:13:44.730
This is why I hate Mist People.

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:49.130
I'm going to the pond.

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:54.410
I need to find the baby.

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:02.990
It's Erin-chan.

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:06.430
Where could she be going?

00:14:06.430 --> 00:14:07.610
Let's follow her.

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:20.480
In this village is a limestone cave called "Touda Grotto" which is where the Touda are kept.

00:14:20.730 --> 00:14:28.190
In the cave, there are multiple waterways known as the "Touda Way," as well as water reservoirs referred to as ponds,

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:31.520
and each of these nurtures a Touda.

00:14:32.110 --> 00:14:37.690
It's this village's treasure, and a place that must be protected.

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:41.070
Chief, a baby Touda has escaped.

00:14:41.680 --> 00:14:43.210
To outside of the ponds?

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:46.720
No.  I think it's still somewhere in the ponds.

00:14:46.720 --> 00:14:50.410
Wadan.  Gather all the men and search throughout the ponds.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:51.240
Yes, sir!

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:55.720
Soyon.

00:14:55.720 --> 00:15:00.820
The reason why I let you, an Arryo, stay here despite the danger of violating the village's code

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:06.190
is by the will of Asson, a man who thought highly of your knowledge and skill as a beastinarian of the Mist People.

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:08.370
Do you understand?

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:10.620
Yes.

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:13.630
Kids aren't allowed in!

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:15.280
But Mom's...

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:19.030
Even if you're the Chief's granddaughter, no means no.

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:23.690
Keep searching!

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:34.670
Hey, this is bad.

00:15:34.670 --> 00:15:37.050
We'll get yelled at if we go in without permission.

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:40.040
It's a crisis of the village, so just come.

00:15:40.590 --> 00:15:41.980
But...

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:44.450
Hey, wait!

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:54.120
Where's the Touda?

00:15:57.780 --> 00:16:00.000
Hey, it's dangerous here.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.080
Be careful.

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:05.560
This way!

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:06.900
You can tell?

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:09.970
The water is brought into the grotto from the mountain,

00:16:09.970 --> 00:16:12.890
so the Touda was probably carried to that pond by the flow.

00:16:12.890 --> 00:16:14.290
So it's probably this way.

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:17.880
You're amazing, Erin-chan!

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:20.370
Hey, wait!

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:22.710
Did you drain the water from the baby's pond?

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:23.800
Yeah.

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:25.210
Let's check the other ponds, too.

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:26.630
It could have wandered in.

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:34.070
Hey, when will we be able to take care of the Kiba?

00:16:34.490 --> 00:16:38.540
Kiba are special Touda that we're taking care of for the Grand Duke.

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:40.820
It won't be until we get permission from the Chief.

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:44.610
But Soyon's taking care of it, isn't she?

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:46.790
Don't mention that.

00:16:47.010 --> 00:16:49.040
It's part of the village code the Chief made.

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:52.090
The water's drained.

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:54.240
That must be the baby's pond.

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:57.170
Erin-chan?

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:06.850
I'm going, too.

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:10.840
Okay, me too.

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:14.820
This is old straw.

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:17.020
How can you tell that?

00:17:17.020 --> 00:17:20.430
Old straw ferments, so it becomes warmer.

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:24.120
You're right, it's warm.

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:25.720
And it smells, too.

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:28.280
Hey, let's get out of here already.

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:36.630
Mom had said to replace it with new straw, too.

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:42.470
Erin-chan!

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:59.860
It might still be in this pond.

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:06.620
Where are you going?

00:18:07.030 --> 00:18:09.200
Hey, Erin-chan!

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:23.590
I found it!

00:18:23.590 --> 00:18:24.730
Really?

00:18:24.730 --> 00:18:26.330
It's hiding in here.

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:30.560
It must have run away from the scent of the old straw.

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:36.020
Come here.

00:18:44.110 --> 00:18:45.100
Watch out.

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:46.360
Yeah.

00:18:46.360 --> 00:18:47.580
I'm letting go, okay?

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:49.180
All right.

00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:50.580
It's okay now.

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:59.000
It's from the baby's pond.

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:01.260
Soyon!

00:19:16.240 --> 00:19:17.220
The Kiba...

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:09.990
Mom...

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:31.550
Is the Touda dead?

00:20:31.550 --> 00:20:33.310
No, it's only petrified.

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:40.300
Erin!  Why are you here?!

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:43.230
We found the baby.

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:54.560
You came here for me?

00:20:54.740 --> 00:20:58.790
Yes.  I'm sorry I came in here without permission.

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:01.730
Erin, thank you.

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:05.050
But, please, don't do anything as dangerous as this ever again.

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:06.480
Do you understand?

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:08.880
Yes.

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:13.230
Why did it run away?

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:16.470
The straw was old.

00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:17.250
"The straw?"

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:22.010
That's why the baby was in the hole, avoiding the smell and the heat.

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:25.690
Wadan!

00:21:25.990 --> 00:21:30.150
It wasn't dirty, so I thought it was all right.

00:21:30.480 --> 00:21:32.910
Touda are delicate creatures.

00:21:32.910 --> 00:21:36.700
Won't you just listen to what I say even if it's only a detail?

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:38.060
I... ah...

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:39.280
I'm sorry.

00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:46.510
Erin, were you scared?

00:21:46.510 --> 00:21:48.060
I was.

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:48.970
But...

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:53.020
I want to become a doctor like you!

00:21:57.840 --> 00:22:02.050
This village revolves around Touda.

00:22:02.760 --> 00:22:06.520
But Touda are different from us humans.

00:22:06.900 --> 00:22:08.360
They're wild beasts.

00:22:08.360 --> 00:22:09.970
Never forget that.

00:22:11.460 --> 00:22:12.330
Okay.

00:22:12.660 --> 00:22:14.570
"Touda are wild beasts."

00:22:14.570 --> 00:22:19.900
Erin has yet to understand the true meaning of that statement.

00:22:20.720 --> 00:22:29.380
Still, she did learn that Touda aren't just cute, tame beasts.

00:24:02.380 --> 00:24:07.930
A Touda rider comes to Ake with a sick Touda, and the village goes wild.

00:24:08.380 --> 00:24:12.970
He wants his Touda seen by the best
beastinarian in the village.

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:15.270
So my Mom comes into play.

00:24:15.680 --> 00:24:18.270
I've got to work hard for my Mom, too.

00:24:19.600 --> 00:24:22.480
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Soyon the Beastinarian.

00:24:25.030 --> 00:25:24.510
Soyon the Beastinarian
